OL,3,GNEWSAPatients unable to access GP
OL,4,Awebsites
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients have been alerted that their
OL,7,FGPs' websites are unavailable due to a
OL,8,F"technical issue" at a company that
OL,9,Fprovides the services.
OL,11,FGP practices in England and Wales that
OL,12,Fuse the company Silicon Practice are
OL,13,Faffected, with access to their websites
OL,14,Fdisrupted after the company went into
OL,15,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
