OL,3,GNEWSAPatients unable to access GP
OL,4,Awebsites
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of practices in
OL,7,FGloucestershire are offline, including
OL,8,FThe Willow Tree Surgery in Stonehouse,
OL,9,Fwhich sent an urgent message to
OL,10,Fpatients reminding them they can still
OL,11,Fuse the NHS App and order prescriptions
OL,12,Fby calling the practice.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for NHS Gloucestershire
OL,15,FICB said it is "working with practices
OL,16,Fand partners to resolve the issue as
OL,17,Fquickly as possible".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
